flowchart LR
  A[Start]
  A --> B[Load prompts and config]
  B --> C[Init Gemini RemoveBg Printify]
  C --> D{For each keyword}

  D --> E[Generate and filter ideas]
  E --> F{For each selected idea}
  F --> G[Generate design image]
  G --> H{Manual review enabled}
  H -->|Yes| I[Keep retry reject]
  H -->|No| J[Auto approve]
  I --> K[Approved design]
  J --> K

  K --> L[Remove background]
  L --> M[Create default color mockup]
  M --> N[Generate final mockup and crop]
  N --> O[Generate title description tags]
  O --> P[Upload assets and build payload]
  P --> Q[Create Printify product]
  Q --> R{Schedule new products}
  R -->|Yes| S[Append both schedule files]
  R -->|No| T[Skip schedule append]
  S --> U[Save artifacts]
  T --> U

  U --> V{Any success for keyword}
  V -->|Yes| W[Mark ideas as published]
  V -->|No| X[Leave ideas.csv unchanged]
  W --> D
  X --> D
  D --> Y[Done]

  Z[Post dry run helper] --> Z1[Load existing folder artifacts]
  Z1 --> Z2[Build payload and create product]
  Z2 --> Z3[Optional schedule append]
